// yel's standard library, written in yel over the prelude's externs (runtime/prelude.yel), as
// Porffor's builtins (compiler/builtins) are written in JS over its intrinsics. Every program
// reaches its names without an include, after its own and the prelude's: a program naming a func
// as one here names its own. One file for each part: text, buffer, char, list, number, async, streams.

package yel:std@0.1.0;
